title: Campaign
subtitle: Win over delegations in one region of the galaxy.
is-card: true
tags: caucus_affairs
card-image: img/card_campaign.svg
view-if: campaign_timer <= 0
on-arrival: turn_actions += 1; campaign_timer = 3; campaign_timer = 1 if election_season; last_card_timer = "campaign"
new-page: true

= Campaign

Senators answer to their home worlds, and home worlds can be persuaded. Where should the Caucus spend its effort? [? if election_season : It is election season, so the Caucus can campaign again next turn. ?]

- @core: The Core Worlds.
- @colonies: The Colonies and Inner Rim.
- @midrim: The Mid Rim and Expansion Region.
- @outer: The Outer Rim Territories.
- @corporate: The corporate holdings.
- @shoestring: Campaign on a shoestring.
- @easy_discard

@core
subtitle: −1 political capital.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; cm_region = "core"
go-to: message

@colonies
subtitle: −1 political capital.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; cm_region = "colonies"
go-to: message

@midrim
subtitle: −1 political capital.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; cm_region = "midrim"
go-to: message

@outer
subtitle: −1 political capital.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; cm_region = "outer"
go-to: message

@corporate
subtitle: −1 political capital.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; cm_region = "corporate"
go-to: message

@shoestring
subtitle: Free. A small boost in a random region.
on-arrival: {! var r = SW.REGIONS[Math.floor(Math.random() * SW.REGIONS.length)]; Q[r + '_rc'] += 1.2 * SW.unity(Q); Q.shoestring_region = SW.REGION_NAMES[r]; !}

Volunteers and borrowed shuttles carry the Caucus's message to the [+ shoestring_region +].

@message
on-arrival: {! SW.campaignPreview(Q); !}

What will the Caucus campaign on? A message lands differently depending on the region and the moment: clean government needs a corrupt Senate and clean hands, Rim relief needs hardship and a record of delivering it, security needs fear, and peace can backfire when people are afraid.

- @msg_clean: Clean government.
- @msg_relief: Relief for the Rim.
- @msg_security: Security and order.
- @msg_peace: Peace.
- @msg_republic: The Republic and its laws.

@msg_clean
subtitle: Expected: [+ cm_word_clean +].
on-arrival: {! SW.campaignStart(Q, 'clean'); !}
go-to: result if not cm_disrupted; disrupted if cm_disrupted

@msg_relief
subtitle: Expected: [+ cm_word_relief +].
on-arrival: {! SW.campaignStart(Q, 'relief'); !}
go-to: result if not cm_disrupted; disrupted if cm_disrupted

@msg_security
subtitle: Expected: [+ cm_word_security +]. The Pacifists dislike it.
on-arrival: {! SW.campaignStart(Q, 'security'); !}
go-to: result if not cm_disrupted; disrupted if cm_disrupted

@msg_peace
subtitle: Expected: [+ cm_word_peace +]. The Hawks dislike it.
on-arrival: {! SW.campaignStart(Q, 'peace'); !}
go-to: result if not cm_disrupted; disrupted if cm_disrupted

@msg_republic
subtitle: Expected: [+ cm_word_republic +].
on-arrival: {! SW.campaignStart(Q, 'republic'); !}
go-to: result if not cm_disrupted; disrupted if cm_disrupted

@disrupted

The Caucus's rally in the [+ cm_region_name +] is stormed by [+ cm_disruptor +]. Speakers are shouted down, delegates are threatened, and the HoloNet cameras are rolling. How will the Caucus protect its people?

*Their strength is about [+ cm_threat +]. The Judicial Forces bring about [+ jf_txt +]; local security, where we are popular, about [+ cm_local +][? if senate_guard_reformed : ; the reformed Senate Guard, 5?].*

- @protect_judicials: Call in the Judicial Forces.
- @protect_guard: Ask the Senate Guard to protect us.
- @protect_local: Rely on local security.
- @cancel: Cancel the rally.

@protect_judicials
subtitle: The Pacifists dislike the Caucus relying on armed force.
on-arrival: {! SW.campaignProtect(Q, 'judicials'); !}
go-to: protected

@protect_guard
view-if: senate_guard_reformed
subtitle: The reformed Senate Guard answers to the Senate, and is formidable.
on-arrival: {! SW.campaignProtect(Q, 'guard'); !}
go-to: protected

@protect_local
on-arrival: {! SW.campaignProtect(Q, 'local'); !}
go-to: protected

@cancel
subtitle: No harm done, except to our pride.
on-arrival: {! SW.momentum(Q, -0.2, 'a cancelled rally'); !}

The Caucus calls off the rally. The HoloNet calls it a retreat.

@protected

[? if cm_protect_won : The rally is protected and goes ahead. Order kept, and seen to be kept, wins the Caucus a little respect. ?][? if not cm_protect_won : The protection fails. The rally breaks up in chaos, and the [+ cm_disruptor +] claim a victory. ?][? if cm_force_note : The Pacifists warn that the Caucus is starting to look like a party with a private army. ?]

[? if cm_protect_won : Our campaign on [+ cm_msg_name +] in the [+ cm_region_name +] was [+ cm_word +]. ?]

@result

[? if cm_backfired : The Caucus campaigns on [+ cm_msg_name +] in the [+ cm_region_name +], and it backfires: frightened voters hear weakness. ?][? if not cm_backfired : The Caucus campaigns on [+ cm_msg_name +] in the [+ cm_region_name +]. The message lands [+ cm_word +]. ?]
